@startuml Sum_Ssfm_DTCU1962_Handler
top to bottom direction
skinparam linetype ortho

legend top left
    "Sum_Ssfm_DTCU1962_Handler"

**Interfaces Legend**
   //II152 //: ERRH_ExecutionStatus
   //ri116 //: SSC_E_KeySlotVerify<n>
   //II191 //: Debounced Error
   //II150 //: BatteryVoltage 
   //II154 //: batteryvoltage_RecoveryTimer
   //II153 //: reset_RecoveryTimer
   //II08 //: PNs_Info
   //II156 //: isTransportMode
   //II157 //: DisableDTCs
   //II165 //: SECPError_Occurred
   //pi160 //: SSC_KeySlotVerify<n>_SetEventStatus
   //II192 //: Undebounced Error
   
endlegend

note top of EC
It is responsible for asking the DEM to set the DTC 1962. 
In particular, it verifies if the SSC reports errors for each key slot and, in case, it asks the DEM to set/clear the DTC accordingly.
end note

component [SSFM::Sum_Ssfm_DTCU1962_Handler] as EC{
    portin ri116
    portout pi160

	[Sum_Ssfm_DTCU1962_Handler]  as E
}
   interface II152
   interface II150
   interface II154
   interface II153
   interface II08
   interface II156
   interface II157
   interface II165
   interface II191
   interface II192

  II152 -> E
  II150 -> E
  II08 -> E
  ri116 -> E
  II154 -> E
  II153 -> E
  II156 -> E
  II157 -> E
  II165 -> E
  II191 -> E
  E -> pi160
  E -> II192  


@enduml
